{
  "name" : "Hanson2016 - Toxicity Management in CAR T cell therapy for B-ALL",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This model provides an in silico mathematical platform to explore the interactions between chimeric antigen receptor-modified T cells, inflammatory toxicitiy, and the tumour burdens of individual patients.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
